ight the Gadoll daily, and Tankers, those without the skills to fight. One day, Natsume, a Tanker girl who dreams of becoming a Gear meets surly Kaburagi, an armor repairman of Deca-dence.\n\nThis chance meeting between the seemingly two opposites, the girl with a positive attitude who never gives up on her dreams and the realist who has given up on his, will eventually shake the future course of this world.\n\n(Source: Funimation)"},"tags":[{"name":"Dystopian","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Video Games","rank":87,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Kaiju","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cyborg","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence","rank":81,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Augmented Reality","rank":75,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Robots","rank":71,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Found Family","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Steampunk","rank":69,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tanned Skin","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":57,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":35,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Satire","rank":35,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"DECA-DENCE","english":"DECA-DENCE","native":"デカダンス","romaji":"Deca-Dence","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"没落要塞"}]},"trailer":{"id":"wqCfnp_fGwo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wqCfnp_fGwo/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}